  "notes": "CR 701.60c: a suspected creature has menace for as long as it is suspected. Added in engine-apply.js's trait-only branch of ADD_ABILITY, only on a creature. Conor asked for Menace only; \"This creature can't block\" is not added.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "add": "Grizzly Bears",
      "as": "bears"
    },
